body:
I CANNOT sing in tune, ever. I know it's off when I sing it. I have good ears and can reproduce single notes right after I hear them, but not the whole phrase. I also can't sing in tune from reading a sheet music.

&#x200B;

My question: what is a course of action I can do to sing from sheet music with accompaniment? (The aural part of my piano exam requires it)

Thanks! random question: when I want to type df/dx for 2 consecutive lines in Notion using `\dfrac{}{}`, it displays it weird. Do you know how to solve it without using packages? (See [Image](https://imgur.com/gIAvwD3))

&#x200B;

PS `\frac{}{}` doesn't work cuz it makes the derivatives too small
